%% title: AML / Court-Order Freeze Workflow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Compliance as Compliance Officer
    participant AdminUI as admin-ui
    participant AccountSvc as account-service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as outbox table
    participant Kafka as Kafka\nopenbank.account.events.v1
    participant AuditSvc as audit-service
    participant NotifSvc as notification-service

    Compliance->>AdminUI: Initiate freeze\n(court order / AML hit)
    AdminUI->>AccountSvc: POST /api/v1/accounts/{id}/freeze\n{reason, reference}

    AccountSvc->>DB: BEGIN
    AccountSvc->>DB: SELECT account WHERE id=? FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>AccountSvc: account (status=ACTIVE)

    AccountSvc->>DB: UPDATE accounts SET status='FROZEN'
    AccountSvc->>Outbox: INSERT AccountFrozen event
    AccountSvc->>DB: COMMIT

    AccountSvc-->>AdminUI: 200 OK (account snapshot)

    Note over Outbox,Kafka: Transactional outbox relay (async)
    Outbox->>Kafka: AccountFrozen {accountId, reason, frozenBy, frozenAt}

    Kafka-->>AuditSvc: persist immutable audit record\n(10-year retention)
    Kafka-->>NotifSvc: send freeze notification\nto account owner

    Note over Compliance,NotifSvc: Unfreeze path (mirror)
    Compliance->>AdminUI: Initiate unfreeze
    AdminUI->>AccountSvc: POST /api/v1/accounts/{id}/unfreeze
    AccountSvc->>DB: UPDATE accounts SET status='ACTIVE'
    AccountSvc->>Outbox: INSERT AccountUnfrozen event
    Outbox->>Kafka: AccountUnfrozen {accountId, clearedBy, clearedAt}
    Kafka-->>AuditSvc: persist audit record
